  abstract = {\emph{Context{$<$}i/{$>$}. Robotic and human activities in cislunar space are expected to rapidly increase in the future. Modeling, joint analysis, and sharing of time measurements made in the vicinity of the Moon may require calculating a lunar timescale and transforming it into other timescales.\emph{Aims{$<$}i/{$>$}. For users, we present a ready-to-use software package of lunar time ephemeris LTE440 that can calculate the lunar coordinate time (TCL) and its relations with the barycentric coordinate time (TCB) and the barycentric dynamical time (TDB).\emph{Methods{$<$}i/{$>$}. According to the International Astronomical Union Resolutions on relativistic timescales, we numerically calculated the relativistic time-dilation integral in the TCL-TCB or TCL-TDB transformation with the JPL ephemeris DE440 including the gravitational contributions from the Sun, all planets, the main belt asteroids, and the Kuiper belt objects.\emph{Results{$<$}i/{$>$}. At a conservative estimate, LTE440 has an accuracy better than 0.15 ns before 2050 and a numerical precision at the level of 1 ps throughout its entire time span. The secular drifts between the coordinate times in LTE440 are respectively estimated as {$\langle$}d TCL/d TCB{$\rangle$} = 1-1.482 536 216 7 \texttimes{} 10\textsuperscript{-8{$<$}sup/{$>$} and {$\langle$}d TCL/d TDB{$\rangle$} = 1 + 6.798 355 24 \texttimes{} 10\textsuperscript{-10{$<$}sup/{$>$}. Its most significant periodic variations are an annual term with an amplitude of 1.65 ms and a monthly term with an amplitude of 126 \textmu s.\emph{Conclusions{$<$}i/{$>$}. LTE440 might satisfy most current needs and the data files are publicly available.}}}}}}}},
  copyright = {\copyright{} The Authors 2025},
  langid = {english},
  annotation = {titleTranslation: 月球时间星历LTE440：定义、算法与性能\\
abstractTranslation: 背景。未来地月空间的机器人及人类活动预计将迅速增加。对月球附近的时间测量进行建模、联合分析和共享，可能需要计算月球时间尺度并将其转换为其他时间尺度。  \\
目的。对于用户，我们提供了一个即用型月球时间历表LTE440软件包，能够计算月球坐标时（TCL）及其与地心坐标时（TCB）和地心动态时（TDB）的关系。  \\
方法。根据国际天文学联合会关于相对论时间尺度的决议，我们利用JPL历表DE440，数值计算了TCL-TCB或TCL-TDB转换中的相对论时间膨胀积分，包括了太阳、所有行星、主带小行星和柯伊伯带天体的引力贡献。  \\
结果。据保守估计，LTE440在2050年前的精度优于0.15纳秒，且在整个时间跨度内数值精度达到皮秒量级。LTE440中坐标时之间的长期漂移分别估算为{$\langle$}d TCL/d TCB{$\rangle$} = 1-1.482 536 216 7 \texttimes{} 10\textsuperscript{-8} 和 {$\langle$}d TCL/d TDB{$\rangle$} = 1 + 6.798 355 24 \texttimes{} 10\textsuperscript{-10}。其最显著的周期变化为一年度项（振幅1.65毫秒）和月度项（振幅126微秒）。  \\
结论。LTE440可能满足当前大多数需求，数据文件已公开提供。},
  file = {/home/ouyangjiahong/Zotero/storage/36QVFM3P/Lu 等 - 2025 - Lunar time ephemeris LTE440 definitions, algorithm, and performance.pdf}
}

