  urldate = {2025-11-27},
  abstract = {This contribution deals with fast Earth-Moon transfers with ballistic capture in the patched three-body model. We compute ensembles of preliminary solutions using a model that takes into account the relative inclination of the orbital planes of the primaries. The ballistic capture orbits around the Moon are obtained relying on the hyperbolic invariant structures associated to the collinear Lagrangian points of the Earth-Moon system, and the Sun-Earth system portion of the transfers are quasi-periodic orbits obtained by a genetic algorithm. The trajectories are designed to be good initial guesses to search optimal cost-efficient short-time EarthMoon transfers with ballistic capture in more realistic models.},
  langid = {english},
  annotation = {titleTranslation: 快速地月转移与弹道捕获\\
abstractTranslation: 本文探讨了在拼接三体模型中利用弹道捕获实现地月快速转移的方法。我们通过考虑主天体轨道平面相对倾角的模型，计算了初始解的集合。月球周围的弹道捕获轨道依赖于与地月系统共线拉格朗日点相关的双曲不变结构，而转移轨道中太阳-地球系统部分则是通过遗传算法获得的准周期轨道。这些轨迹被设计为良好的初始猜测，以便在更真实的模型中搜索具有弹道捕获的最优、经济、短时间地月转移方案。},
