  doi = {10.1007/s10409-014-0071-4},
  urldate = {2025-11-06},
  abstract = {Asteroid exploration trajectories which start from a lunar orbit are investigated in this work. It is assumed that the probe departs from lunar orbit and returns to the vicinity of Earth, then escapes from the Earth by performing a perigee maneuver. A low-energy transfer in Sun-EarthMoon system is adopted. First, the feasible region of lowenergy transfer from lunar orbit to perigee within 5 000 km height above the Earth surface in Sun-Earth-Moon system is calculated and analyzed. Three transfer types are found, i.e., large maneuver and fast transfers, small maneuver and fast transfers, and disordered and slow transfers. Most of feasibility trajectories belong to the first two types. Then, the lowenergy trajectory leg from lunar orbit to perigee and a heliocentric trajectory leg from perigee to asteroid are patched by a perigee maneuver. The optimal full-transfer trajectory is obtained by exploiting the differential evolution algorithm. Finally, taking 4179 Toutatis asteroid as the target, some low-energy transfer trajectories are obtained and analyzed.},
  langid = {english},
  annotation = {titleTranslation: 日地月系统中从月球轨道至小行星的低能量转移轨道设计\\
abstractTranslation: 本文研究了从月球轨道出发的小行星探测轨迹。假设探测器从月球轨道出发，返回地球附近，然后通过近地点机动逃离地球。采用日-地-月系统中的低能转移方式。首先，计算并分析了在日-地-月系统中，从月球轨道到近地点（距离地球表面5000公里高度内）的低能转移可行域。发现了三种转移类型：大机动快速转移、小机动快速转移以及无序慢速转移。大多数可行轨迹属于前两种类型。然后，通过近地点机动，将月球轨道到近地点的低能转移段与近地点到小行星的日心转移段拼接起来。利用差分进化算法获得了最优的全转移轨迹。最后，以4179 Toutatis小行星为目标，获得并分析了一些低能转移轨迹。},
  file = {/home/ouyangjiahong/Zotero/storage/78GCD5NP/Wang 等 - 2014 - Design of low-energy transfer from lunar orbit to asteroid in the sun-earth-moon system.pdf}
}

