  urldate = {2026-02-21},
  abstract = {This paper presents an efficient indirect optimization method for the time- and fuel-optimal low-thrust many-revolution transfers with averaged dynamics. Compared with the previous indirect method, the proposed method involves a new set of variables and several near-optimal control laws to formulate the two-point boundary value problem based on three practical assumptions. Then, the costate transformations between two reference frames are first derived with respect to the the corresponding Eulerian angles, such that the switching function can be expressed with a six-degree polynomial function and the number of parameters used to determine the energy-optimal solutions is reduced to 6. Finally, a neural network is trained to generated the initial guesses, and the solution algorithms for solving the time- and fuel-optimal problem are formulated. Numerical simulations demonstrate that the convergence ratio of initial guesses is higher than [Formula: see text], the proposed assumptions are reasonable for guaranteeing the near optimality, and the presented method can obtain convergent solutions within tenths of a second for the Earth- and moon-centered external/interior transfers considering the shadow [Formula: see text] and third-body perturbations.},
  langid = {english},
  annotation = {titleTranslation: 基于解析开关检测的平均动力学低推力轨迹优化\\
abstractTranslation: 本文提出了一种高效间接优化方法，用于解决基于平均动力学的多圈低推力转移中的时间和燃料最优问题。与先前间接方法相比，该方法引入了一组新变量及若干近最优控制律，基于三个实际假设构建了两点边值问题。随后，首次推导了参考系间关于对应欧拉角的协态变换，使得切换函数可表示为六次多项式函数，且用于确定能量最优解的参数数量缩减至6。最后，训练神经网络生成初值猜测，并构造了求解时间和燃料最优问题的算法。数值仿真表明，初值猜测的收敛率高于[公式：见原文]，所提假设能合理保证近最优性，且该方法可在几十毫秒内获得考虑阴影[公式：见原文]及第三体摄动的地心/月心外部/内部转移的收敛解},
  file = {/home/ouyangjiahong/Zotero/storage/B4ULPESK/Wu 等 - 2024 - Low-Thrust Trajectory Optimization with Averaged Dynamics Using Analytical Switching Detection.pdf}
}

