@article{ZhangShuLiYanYiGongShengRenGongZhiNengJiShuHeYiChongSuChuangZaoLiFanShiSiDiGeLeJiShuZheXueShiJiaoXiaDeJiaoYuShenSi2026,
  title = {{延异共生：人工智能技术何以重塑创造力范式------斯蒂格勒技术哲学视角下的教育审思}},
  author = {{张淑莉} and {张雨强}},
